FG-559 / PRD-a §4.2 PROBE 7 — RED RUNTIME CAPABILITY vs FILESYSTEM MUTATION AUTHORITY.

╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ SECTION 0 — SUPERSEDED: the original "one dispatch per supported runtime / identical across three"  ║
║ conclusion below (SECTION 2) is INVALID. It did NOT execute three runtimes.                         ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

WHAT WAS WRONG (operator finding, verified against durable manifests):
The three original probe runs were dispatched with `forge invoke red-wide --runtime <rt>`. On this host
`~/.forge/model-policy.yml` pins `overrides.agents.red-wide: codex-subscription`, and that pin OVERRIDES the
`--runtime` flag. All three original runs therefore resolved to codex-subscription — three Codex executions,
not one-per-runtime. Proof (durable `manifest.json`, field `model.resolvedBy` / `runtime.name`):
  labelled codex  run-runtime-capability-probe-codex-subscription-57d5ae → runtime.name=codex-subscription  resolvedBy=overrides.agents.red-wide
  labelled claude run-runtime-capability-probe-claude-oauth-a7c1f4       → runtime.name=codex-subscription  resolvedBy=overrides.agents.red-wide   [NOT claude]
  labelled pi     run-runtime-capability-probe-pi-oauth-3dd9b5           → runtime.name=codex-subscription  resolvedBy=overrides.agents.red-wide   [NOT pi]
A run-title or a requested `--runtime` value is NOT runtime identity. The durable manifest is. `command -v codex
claude pi` in the IDENTITY block proves the three binaries EXIST in the shared image; it does NOT prove which
executable orchestrated the task. The Codex arm was genuine; the "claude" and "pi" arms were duplicate Codex.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
SECTION 1 — GENUINE REPLACEMENT EVIDENCE (this is the authoritative record)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

METHOD: dispatch is forced with `forge invoke red-wide --profile <profile> --read-only` (project forge-plan-a
@ 3b76153). `--profile` (AWN-7) is highest profile-selection precedence and OVERRIDES `overrides.agents.red-wide`
(confirmed: every arm's manifest shows `model.resolvedBy = cli.--profile`). Runtime identity was VERIFIED from
the durable manifest BEFORE the arm was accepted. No installed runtime or model policy was modified.

