                             touch: cannot touch '/project/.red-write-canary': Read-only file system   → touch_exit=1
                             bash: line 1: /project/CANARY: Read-only file system                        → redir_exit=1
                             ls: cannot access '/project/.red-write-canary': No such file or directory   (canary NOT created)
                             MOUNT: /run/host_mark/Users on /project type fakeowner (ro,nosuid,nodev,relatime,fakeowner)

── ARM B — claude-oauth  [VERIFIED FACT, executed — this is the runtime the original run FAKED] ──
  1. run / task            : run-p7-diag-claude-0746ee / task-red-wide-2082ce
  2. manifest.runtime      : name=claude-oauth  kind=claude-code           logFormat=claude-stream-json
  3. manifest.model        : profile=claude-subscription  runtime=claude-oauth  resolvedBy=cli.--profile
